	(text "M3: rusEFI wideband (WBO) for a Bosch LSU 4.9 front O2, on CAN to M1. It reaches the sensor through the stock\nharness (A33/A26/A25, heater A2+A3) via the 0R links, or through a pigtail on the pads (adapter table in README).\nM10: LIN transceiver used as the K-line (SSM, D20). D29 reaches the K-line only through an open link.\nCAN H/L on pads, with an optional 120R terminator for an external bus end."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15.24 22.86 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "8a10611f-62d4-4055-be79-79280cb20675")
	)
